 if you are full and did not take any. Ammo sometimes does not transfer to you.\nExecuting stunned enemies sometimes triggers backwards, i mean the stunned enemy will make their special attack or execution move on you.\nOrks sound more human than your average bar patron ad the beginning of the evening.\nEnemies attack only you, but at least your NPC companions also do some damage to the enemy.\nStory is OK, but many plot elements are stupid and you will feel \"secondary shame\" that this came from a company that makes strategy and tactical games.\nEtc, etc. For 36 euros, this 6 hour game is not worth it in my opinion.", "timestamp_created": 1750600235, "timestamp_updated": 1751027496, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.452302634716033936", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197879822", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042317098", "personaname": "wieczornyPyton", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wieczornypyton/", "num_games_owned": 2825, "num_reviews": 1423, "playtime_forever": 11, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11, "last_played": 1750599747, "avatar": "1149fef9ea8439558379ab1d1436225db50b4650"}, "language": "english", "review": "5/10", "timestamp_created": 1750600000, "timestamp_updated": 1750600000, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197859127", "author": {"steamid": "76561198970070779", "personaname": "ghostaper16", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profi